flowchart TB
  root[已验证 Workspace Root] --> inventory[Inventory<br/>pathspec 范围与文件身份]
  inventory --> map[Repository Map<br/>Git 状态、构建和测试命令]
  inventory --> index[Tree-sitter 符号与关系索引]
  index --> fts[(SQLite FTS5)]
  task[任务、路径、Symbol、Diff 与最近读取] --> query[RepositoryTaskQueryBuilder]
  query --> retrieve[多路有界候选召回]
  fts --> retrieve
  index --> retrieve
  retrieve --> ranking[精确匹配、BM25、RapidFuzz<br/>关系、Diff、近期资料与路径规则]
  ranking --> budget[按结果数、字节与时间预算选择]
  map --> context[ContextPlan 与证据引用]
  budget --> context
  watch[watchfiles 事件] -.仅使缓存失效.-> inventory
  context --> tools[需要当前正文时使用受控读取或 bundled ripgrep]
